            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Setup</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Typoless explains itself before macOS asks for permission. The system dialog now waits for the Allow button.</li>
    <li>The languages a new install starts with come from your Mac instead of English and German.</li>
    <li>Finish Setup sits under the line in the menu that asks for it.</li>
    <li>A debug build is its own app, so two copies can no longer look the same in System Settings.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
